<title>USA: Atchison Casting begins trading on NYSE.</title>
<headline>Atchison Casting begins trading on NYSE.</headline>
<dateline>ATCHISON, Kan. 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Atchison Casting Corp said its common stock began trading on the New York Stock Exchange on Wednesday under the symbol FDY.</p>
<p>Atchison had been trading on the NASDAQ National Market System since it went public in October 1993.</p>
<p>The company produces iron, steel and nonferrous castings for a wide variety of equipment, capital goods and consumer markets.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787</p>
</text>
